records.storyText:
Built a simple web app that tells you which open-source LLMs will work on your hardware.
It auto-detects your specs, shows compatible models from Hugging Face, gives realistic performance estimates (tokens&#x2F;sec), and recommends quantization settings. You can also manually input specs to see &quot;what if I upgraded my RAM?&quot;
Made this after wasting time downloading giant models only to find they crawled on my hardware. Hope it saves you some frustration!
